# --- Secrets -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Never commit these. The etc tarball contains splunk.secret, and passwd holds
# the Splunk user hashes, so these rules are generic on purpose: a backup
# dropped in a new folder must stay ignored without editing this file first.
**/.env
**/passwd
**/data-backup/
*.tar.gz
splunk.secret
*.lic
*.license

# --- Environments / build artefacts ------------------------------------------
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# --- Work in progress ---------------------------------------------------------
# REST API snapshot tooling. Unfinished, kept locally until it does something
# useful. Anchored with a leading slash so it cannot match the top-level
# snapshots/ directory.
/splunk-snapshot/
